// Abilities, ported from benilla-app's survivors/data.rs. `visual` is the Spell.dbc id whose
// cast, missile and impact the client shows.
// kind: Bolt (missile at the nearest `count` enemies in `range`, `radius` splash),
//       Strike (instant hit on the nearest `count` in `range`),
//       Nova (everything within `radius` of the caster).
// `missile_speed` is the spell's own projectile speed in Spell.dbc (yards/second); 0 is instant.
// Ground areas are approximated as a Nova around the caster at three ticks' damage; damage over
// time is folded into one Strike; totems cast their own spell on their own beat.
// A description's `{damage}`, `{range}`, `{area}`, `{targets}` and the like are filled with the
// spell's real numbers as cast (see `together_sim::describe` for the list).
// The other classes' new kinds: Ward (banks charges: Heal, Block or Thorns, with overflow when
// full), Buff (an effect on the caster, on allies too when tagged Aura); a Ground with `strikes`
// is a summon (`follows: true`) or a totem; `trap: true` waits for an enemy. A spell tagged
// DamageOverTime but not Direct has no hit: `burn` times its damage comes over `dot_time` sec.
[
    // --- Mage ---
    (key: "frostbolt", name: "Frostbolt", visual: 116, kind: Bolt,
     damage: 12.0, cooldown: 1.3, range: 24.0, missile_speed: 28.0, target: Some(ElitesFirst),
     tags: [Frost, Projectile, Direct, Slow],
     description: "Hurls a bolt of frost at {targets} within {range} yards for {damage} damage, Chilling them ({slow}% slower for {chill} sec)."),
